@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# Captcha regression tests
+
+These tests exercise the real hook with Android's Java implementations of Uri,
+Bundle and JSONObject from Robolectric's `android-all` jar. They do not contact VK,
+solve a challenge, or test WebView rendering.
+
+Run from the repository root with a JDK and these external artifacts:
+
+```sh
+export ANDROID_JAR=/path/to/Android/Sdk/platforms/android-32/android.jar
+export ANDROID_ALL_JAR=/path/to/android-all-12.1-robolectric-8229987.jar
+bash scripts/test_auth.sh
+```
+
+`ECJ_JAR` can optionally select an Eclipse Java compiler jar when only a JRE is
+installed. All generated files go to a temporary directory.
